1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:53,080 --> 00:01:54,920
The rank 1000 Demon Spirit Crystal

25
00:01:55,040 --> 00:01:57,970
Rank 1000
Demon Spirit Crystal

26
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:57,640
can be converted into celestial spiritual energy.

27
00:01:58,120 --> 00:02:00,400
But even if I add all the celestial jades I have,

28
00:02:00,960 --> 00:02:03,600
it would barely be enough to reach Late stage Soul Transformation.

29
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:08,880
Halt, intruder !

30
00:02:11,880 --> 00:02:14,680
I have important matters to discuss with your Commander Wang.

31
00:02:14,720 --> 00:02:16,450
The Ancestor is in seclusion,

32
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:17,730
please come back later.

33
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:25,610
Fellow cultivator Yao, barging in rudely like this

34
00:02:25,520 --> 00:02:27,480
isn't very polite.

35
00:02:28,440 --> 00:02:30,120
Sorry for being rude.

36
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:32,760
I hope fellow cultivator Wang will forgive me

37
00:02:32,640 --> 00:02:35,360
but I really have an urgent request.

38
00:02:35,720 --> 00:02:37,160
If it's not worth my time,

39
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:39,090
then don't blame me for being impolite too.

40
00:02:49,760 --> 00:02:51,000
Fellow cultivator Wang,

41
00:02:51,240 --> 00:02:53,080
this matter is extremely confidential

42
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:55,000
so I need to be on guard.

43
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:56,360
I hope you don't mind.

44
00:02:56,920 --> 00:02:58,680
This whole Demon Spirit Land

45
00:02:58,440 --> 00:03:00,880
used to be the cultivation cave of a Celestial.

46
00:03:01,080 --> 00:03:03,090
After the collapse of the Celestial Realm,

47
00:03:02,880 --> 00:03:04,480
it stopped being used.

48
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:07,410
I accidentally found a path to that celestial cave

49
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:10,760
but I can't break the restrictions outside it alone.

50
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:13,800
I heard fellow cultivator Wang is skilled in restrictions.

51
00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:15,760
If we successfully enter,

52
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:19,200
we will split the celestial artifacts inside equally between us.

53
00:03:19,360 --> 00:03:20,560
What do you think ?

54
00:03:21,160 --> 00:03:23,200
A celestial cave is indeed worth exploring.

55
00:03:23,760 --> 00:03:25,520
But this person isn't trustworthy.

56
00:03:25,920 --> 00:03:27,480
I need to inquire a bit more...

57
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:30,080
I'm at a critical point in my cultivation.

58
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:31,880
I can't help you.

59
00:03:32,320 --> 00:03:33,360
I'm sorry.

60
00:03:34,080 --> 00:03:37,200
I presume fellow cultivator Wang is trying to breakthrough to Late stage

61
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:40,720
but doesn't have enough celestial jades.

62
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:42,320
To show my sincerity,

63
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:43,960
I am willing to provide fellow cultivator Wang

64
00:03:43,720 --> 00:03:46,880
with enough celestial jades to reach Early stage Ascendant.

65
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:48,680
This is the deposit,

66
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:51,930
it should be enough to help you reach Late stage Soul Transformation.

67
00:03:52,040 --> 00:03:53,880
I will give you the rest

68
00:03:53,720 --> 00:03:54,880
if we

69
00:03:54,880 --> 00:03:57,320
succeed in entering the cave.

70
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:59,850
As expected of the Blood Ancestor's daughter...

71
00:03:59,640 --> 00:04:01,160
She really is extravagant.

72
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:03,320
This is too dangerous,

73
00:04:03,640 --> 00:04:05,810
I'm sorry but I'm not willing to take the risk.

74
00:04:07,960 --> 00:04:10,320
If fellow cultivator Wang is worried about safety,

75
00:04:10,440 --> 00:04:12,360
you can take this Blood Soul Pill.

76
00:04:12,640 --> 00:04:14,160
It will ensure your safety.

77
00:04:14,480 --> 00:04:15,880
A Blood Soul Pill !?

78
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:18,570
This pill is refined by the Blood Ancestor's secret technique.

79
00:04:18,320 --> 00:04:20,360
I've heard that even your body is completely destroyed

80
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:21,520
and your Origin Soul crushed,

81
00:04:21,840 --> 00:04:24,320
you can still use this pill to reconstruct them

82
00:04:24,560 --> 00:04:26,530
and be completely unharmed.

83
00:04:26,840 --> 00:04:29,050
If I obtain such a life-saving treasure,

84
00:04:28,840 --> 00:04:30,760
I would be able to escape deadly situations.

85
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:34,760
I've heard of this, it's the Blood Planet's treasure...

86
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:37,480
How is this pill used ?

87
00:04:37,520 --> 00:04:39,560
This is my Yao Family's secret,

88
00:04:39,440 --> 00:04:41,320
I can't reveal it so easily

89
00:04:42,480 --> 00:04:45,960
unless... you agree to come with me.

90
00:04:46,120 --> 00:04:48,400
I'll even give you one more

91
00:04:48,440 --> 00:04:49,880
as payment.

92
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:52,960
Agreed.

93
00:04:54,440 --> 00:04:56,120
Use the method in this jade

94
00:04:56,040 --> 00:04:58,200
to leave a mark on the Blood Soul Pill.

95
00:04:58,440 --> 00:05:01,160
It will link your body and Origin Soul to the pill

96
00:05:01,320 --> 00:05:04,720
to allow you to reconstruct your body and soul.

97
00:05:05,520 --> 00:05:06,840
Let's meet in 3 days

98
00:05:06,880 --> 00:05:09,400
at the hour the purple demon rises

99
00:05:09,880 --> 00:05:11,520
on top of Drum Mountain.

100
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:16,280
When I hold this pill,

101
00:05:16,840 --> 00:05:19,280
it feels like we share the same blood.

102
00:05:31,400 --> 00:05:35,490
3 days later

103
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:39,730
I'm going out for a bit.

104
00:05:40,520 --> 00:05:41,730
While I'm away,

105
00:05:42,080 --> 00:05:44,650
you two will stay in the Black Armor Barracks and wait for me.

106
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:46,080
Remember to cultivate.

107
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:47,280
Understood !

108
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:51,890
Drum Mountain
Demon Spirit Land

109
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:56,160
I've given him enough celestial jades

110
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:57,960
but after 3 days

111
00:05:57,720 --> 00:06:00,200
he still hasn't reached Late stage Soul Transformation.

112
00:06:00,640 --> 00:06:02,960
It seems he isn't very talented.

113
00:06:03,760 --> 00:06:06,280
When the purple demon reaches its peak,

114
00:06:06,840 --> 00:06:09,600
a ray of blood-colored light will come from the compass.

115
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:11,280
Follow me closely.

116
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:18,690
Celestial Qing Lin's cave
Demon Spirit Land

117
00:06:17,440 --> 00:06:19,130
Focus your mind and sit here,

118
00:06:18,880 --> 00:06:20,520
concentrate on your domain.

119
00:06:20,840 --> 00:06:22,760
Once recognized by the golden symbol,

120
00:06:22,760 --> 00:06:24,880
we will walk the Revered Dragon Path.

121
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:35,050
The golden energy entered her body ?

122
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:36,680
Your turn now.

123
00:06:36,760 --> 00:06:38,480
Yao Xixue's body

124
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:40,880
now gives off the pressure of a Celestial.

125
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:07,920
I only got a 3-strokes golden symbol.

126
00:07:08,440 --> 00:07:10,480
He actually obtained at least 6 !

127
00:07:10,840 --> 00:07:13,120
Could it be that his domain is superior to mine ?

128
00:07:13,720 --> 00:07:15,000
How is that possible ?

129
00:07:20,880 --> 00:07:21,920
Let's go.

130
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:24,960
Yao Xixue is very familiar with this place,

131
00:07:25,360 --> 00:07:27,400
it's clearly not her first time entering.

132
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:29,880
As the Blood Ancestor's beloved daughter,

133
00:07:29,960 --> 00:07:32,330
she should have all the celestial artifacts she needs.

134
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:34,120
Why does she risk coming here ?

135
00:07:33,200 --> 00:07:36,650
First platform
Revered Dragon Path

136
00:07:34,840 --> 00:07:37,090
Her obsession with this celestial cave

137
00:07:36,840 --> 00:07:39,410
must be because of the Blood Ancestor's orders.

138
00:07:39,640 --> 00:07:41,280
She must have other objectives.

139
00:07:42,520 --> 00:07:44,720
This place has 12 layers of restrictions,

140
00:07:44,640 --> 00:07:46,600
we will take turns breaking them.

141
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:49,080
I'll take the first layer.

142
00:07:53,680 --> 00:07:54,720
Seal !

143
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:57,560
This statue's cultivation is no less than Soul Transformation.

144
00:07:58,160 --> 00:08:01,130
Can Yao Xixue seal it so easily ?

145
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:08,280
Artifacts from the Blood Planet really are something...

146
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:13,280
This is...

147
00:08:14,440 --> 00:08:15,680
A golden symbol ?

148
00:08:15,880 --> 00:08:17,960
The golden symbol in the statue

149
00:08:17,840 --> 00:08:20,480
is almost identical to the one I just gained from my domain.

150
00:08:21,040 --> 00:08:24,320
Could it be that these golden symbols made of celestial spiritual energy

151
00:08:24,320 --> 00:08:26,280
were sealed inside the statues ?

152
00:08:31,120 --> 00:08:32,760
If that's true,

153
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:35,760
these 12 layers of restrictions aren't obstacles

154
00:08:36,440 --> 00:08:38,720
but an incredible opportunity !

155
00:08:44,600 --> 00:08:48,050
Second platform
Revered Dragon Path

156
00:09:01,640 --> 00:09:03,400
If it's really made of restrictions

157
00:09:04,360 --> 00:09:06,360
then there must be a way to lift them !

158
00:09:16,760 --> 00:09:19,760
With his skill in restrictions, he should be able to break it directly.

159
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:21,920
Why is he fighting with the statue ?

160
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:30,240
As I thought.

161
00:09:30,680 --> 00:09:32,520
This is the restriction's core.

162
00:09:37,520 --> 00:09:38,480
Release !

163
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:54,530
Why is there a golden symbol inside the statue !?

164
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:05,480
This golden symbol

165
00:10:05,640 --> 00:10:08,600
seems to have one more stroke than the one on the first platform.

166
00:10:12,920 --> 00:10:14,560
It was an accident.

167
00:10:14,640 --> 00:10:16,200
He just got lucky, that's all.

168
00:10:18,160 --> 00:10:21,090
Third platform
Revered Dragon Path

169
00:10:17,960 --> 00:10:19,760
I just need to smash the statue,

170
00:10:19,920 --> 00:10:21,280
what's so difficult about it ?

171
00:10:24,560 --> 00:10:26,520
This time it has 3 strokes.

172
00:10:32,560 --> 00:10:34,560
How exactly did I fail ?

173
00:10:34,640 --> 00:10:36,480
Why aren't there any golden symbols !?

174
00:10:36,680 --> 00:10:39,650
Fourth platform
Revered Dragon Path

175
00:10:42,040 --> 00:10:44,090
A 4-strokes golden symbol...

176
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:45,480
As I thought.

177
00:10:45,440 --> 00:10:48,010
Fifth platform
Revered Dragon Path

178
00:10:49,760 --> 00:10:51,720
How exactly did he do it ?

179
00:10:56,080 --> 00:10:58,610
Sixth platform
Revered Dragon Path

180
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:00,250
Seventh platform
Revered Dragon Path

181
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:01,530
Eighth platform
Revered Dragon Path

182
00:11:01,280 --> 00:11:01,970
Ninth platform
Revered Dragon Path

183
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:02,370
Tenth platform
Revered Dragon Path

184
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:03,010
Eleventh platform
Revered Dragon Path

185
00:11:10,160 --> 00:11:11,480
This is the last one,

186
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:14,400
a 12-strokes golden symbol...

187
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:21,120
This is...

188
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:23,200
the character 'Lin' ?

189
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:26,400
I am Qing Lin.

190
00:11:26,800 --> 00:11:29,920
It seems the former owner of this cave was named Qing Lin.

191
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:34,450
Something's wrong...

192
00:11:34,640 --> 00:11:36,080
These 12 layers of restrictions...

193
00:11:36,080 --> 00:11:38,160
kept increasing in difficulty.

194
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:40,520
But with Yao Xixue's strength,

195
00:11:40,640 --> 00:11:43,770
she could easily pass through just by using her artifacts.

196
00:11:44,320 --> 00:11:46,720
Why did she insist on inviting me then ?

197
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:50,200
The restriction statues aren't the final challenge.

198
00:11:50,840 --> 00:11:52,050
This place...

199
00:11:52,800 --> 00:11:54,480
has other dangers.

200
00:12:15,880 --> 00:12:17,930
Ferocious wind blocks the path.

201
00:12:19,160 --> 00:12:20,720
We have no way back.

202
00:12:21,640 --> 00:12:23,080
If you can survive 3 strikes,

203
00:12:23,160 --> 00:12:25,280
you qualify to enter the cave.

204
00:12:26,520 --> 00:12:28,600
We'll each take a strike,

205
00:12:28,640 --> 00:12:30,760
and survive the last one together.

206
00:12:31,080 --> 00:12:32,160
Gentleman,

207
00:12:32,760 --> 00:12:33,840
you're first.

208
00:12:33,840 --> 00:12:35,280
Step forward now.

209
00:12:35,640 --> 00:12:36,680
Fellow cultivator Wang,

210
00:12:36,880 --> 00:12:37,880
please.

211
00:12:38,240 --> 00:12:39,760
And if I refuse ?

212
00:12:40,560 --> 00:12:42,200
As you can see,

213
00:12:42,080 --> 00:12:43,720
the way back is blocked.

214
00:12:43,840 --> 00:12:47,080
All who have obtained a golden symbol

215
00:12:47,160 --> 00:12:50,000
must enter the celestial cave in order to survive.

216
00:12:51,320 --> 00:12:52,360
So...

217
00:12:52,960 --> 00:12:55,280
inviting me to break restrictions was just a pretense.

218
00:12:55,960 --> 00:12:58,280
The real reason was to have me take the strikes for you ?

219
00:12:58,240 --> 00:13:01,800
We just need to withstand these 3 Ascendant level sword strikes together

220
00:13:02,080 --> 00:13:04,480
and we can enter the celestial cave.

221
00:13:04,440 --> 00:13:05,920
Fellow cultivator Yao flatters me.

222
00:13:06,680 --> 00:13:08,720
I'm only at Middle stage Soul Transformation,

223
00:13:09,240 --> 00:13:11,760
how can I withstand Ascendant level sword strikes ?

224
00:13:13,160 --> 00:13:14,280
Wang Lin,

225
00:13:14,440 --> 00:13:16,480
blocking the strikes with me

226
00:13:16,240 --> 00:13:18,200
is your only path to survival.

227
00:13:18,360 --> 00:13:19,800
Succeed and live

228
00:13:19,840 --> 00:13:21,480
or fail and die.

229
00:13:21,560 --> 00:13:22,360
You...

230
00:13:22,440 --> 00:13:24,080
have no choice.

231
00:13:25,640 --> 00:13:26,880
Don't worry,

232
00:13:27,080 --> 00:13:30,120
didn't you already take the Blood Soul Pill ?

233
00:13:30,040 --> 00:13:32,080
Fellow cultivator Yao is quite the schemer.

234
00:13:33,640 --> 00:13:35,480
Likewise.

235
00:13:35,840 --> 00:13:37,280
I hope you will

236
00:13:37,640 --> 00:13:39,280
keep your promise.

237
00:13:46,560 --> 00:13:49,080
With your Middle stage Soul Transformation cultivation,

238
00:13:49,320 --> 00:13:50,880
taking a sword strike

239
00:13:50,640 --> 00:13:52,360
won't necessarily kill you.

240
00:13:58,440 --> 00:13:59,880
Use the Blood Soul Pill's spell now !

241
00:13:59,640 --> 00:14:01,560
You must survive fellow cultivator Wang !

242
00:14:04,200 --> 00:14:07,160
But if you took the fake pill I gave you...

243
00:14:07,520 --> 00:14:09,680
you will die for sure...

244
00:14:11,440 --> 00:14:13,280
The location of this celestial cave

245
00:14:13,040 --> 00:14:15,120
is the ultimate secret of my Yao Family.

246
00:14:15,680 --> 00:14:18,000
How could I let you leave alive ?

247
00:14:18,680 --> 00:14:19,920
Wang Lin,

248
00:14:20,320 --> 00:14:23,480
it should be an honor to sacrifice yourself

249
00:14:23,640 --> 00:14:25,680
for the Yao Family.

250
00:14:27,160 --> 00:14:28,320
The first strike

251
00:14:28,440 --> 00:14:30,080
can be considered blocked.

252
00:14:30,640 --> 00:14:31,920
Are you ready

253
00:14:32,120 --> 00:14:33,920
for the second strike ?

254
00:14:34,680 --> 00:14:35,720
Bring it on !

255
00:14:37,040 --> 00:14:38,920
I entered this place several times.

256
00:14:38,880 --> 00:14:40,080
The statue restrictions

257
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:41,560
can be passed using artifacts.

258
00:14:41,760 --> 00:14:43,400
But for these 3 sword strikes,

259
00:14:43,440 --> 00:14:45,760
I could only block the first 2.

260
00:14:46,160 --> 00:14:48,400
Now that Wang Lin blocked one for me,

261
00:14:48,640 --> 00:14:50,400
I'm sure I can win.

262
00:14:52,520 --> 00:14:54,320
The final strike.

263
00:15:06,760 --> 00:15:07,920
Father...

264
00:15:08,080 --> 00:15:10,450
I didn't fail to meet your expectations !

265
00:15:10,240 --> 00:15:11,680
I did it !

266
00:15:12,120 --> 00:15:13,730
The Yao Family

267
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:15,920
might finally ascend !

268
00:15:15,840 --> 00:15:17,320
Thank you fellow cultivator Yao,

269
00:15:17,760 --> 00:15:19,800
for blocking 2 strikes for me.

270
00:15:19,720 --> 00:15:21,120
You're still alive !?

271
00:15:21,040 --> 00:15:22,640
I suspected all along

272
00:15:22,760 --> 00:15:25,080
that the Blood Soul Pill you gave me was fake.

273
00:15:25,640 --> 00:15:27,400
How could you have given

274
00:15:28,080 --> 00:15:30,810
such a precious treasure to me so easily ?

275
00:15:31,680 --> 00:15:34,680
And you were so concerned about my safety

276
00:15:35,040 --> 00:15:36,720
that you used your Divine Sense

277
00:15:36,800 --> 00:15:39,200
to ensure I took the pill.

278
00:15:39,880 --> 00:15:41,560
If the pill was fake,

279
00:15:41,640 --> 00:15:44,080
then the celestial cave was most likely real.

280
00:15:44,360 --> 00:15:47,760
So I didn't use the celestial jades you gave me to breakthrough.

281
00:15:47,960 --> 00:15:51,410
Instead, I converted them into a celestial crystal and stored it within my body

282
00:15:51,160 --> 00:15:53,120
to use it to save my life.

283
00:15:53,360 --> 00:15:56,970
So you used this celestial crystal to withstand the Ascendant sword strike

284
00:15:56,720 --> 00:15:59,120
and then used the impact to pretend falling in the abyss.

285
00:15:59,120 --> 00:16:00,760
Then you waited for me to withstand 2 strikes

286
00:16:00,560 --> 00:16:01,960
and be weakened

287
00:16:02,040 --> 00:16:03,720
to strike back...

288
00:16:03,960 --> 00:16:05,800
Zhou Wutai told me

289
00:16:05,920 --> 00:16:10,120
that the true use of the straw hat is to conceal your aura.

290
00:16:10,960 --> 00:16:12,480
Don't waste your energy,

291
00:16:13,040 --> 00:16:15,000
I've already sealed your meridians.

292
00:16:15,240 --> 00:16:16,680
Right now, you...

293
00:16:16,760 --> 00:16:19,200
can't even use celestial spiritual energy.

294
00:16:19,640 --> 00:16:20,720
Wang Lin !

295
00:16:21,200 --> 00:16:22,960
You can just kill me !

296
00:16:22,760 --> 00:16:23,800
Kill you ?

297
00:16:24,040 --> 00:16:26,320
I'm sure you took a Blood Soul Pill.

298
00:16:26,680 --> 00:16:30,090
Killing you would just let you return to some blood formation.

299
00:16:30,160 --> 00:16:33,080
But if I use my Life and Death Domain to imprison you,

300
00:16:33,080 --> 00:16:34,560
it won't kill you

301
00:16:34,640 --> 00:16:37,760
and your Blood Soul Pill becomes completely useless...

302
00:16:37,600 --> 00:16:38,480
You !

303
00:16:44,360 --> 00:16:46,280
This woman laid a death trap for me

304
00:16:46,560 --> 00:16:49,680
by using these Ascendant level sword strikes

305
00:16:50,040 --> 00:16:52,120
and the fake Blood Soul Pill.

306
00:16:52,360 --> 00:16:54,760
What kind of celestial treasure is in this cave

307
00:16:54,880 --> 00:16:57,560
to make her go though so much effort ?

308
00:16:58,240 --> 00:17:00,160
The remnant soul of the celestial cave

309
00:17:00,480 --> 00:17:02,680
welcomes Master.

310
00:17:10,520 --> 00:17:12,480
This is the celestial cave token.

311
00:17:12,760 --> 00:17:15,880
Holding this token allows free entry and exit from the cave.

312
00:17:16,520 --> 00:17:17,680
Master,

313
00:17:18,160 --> 00:17:19,720
please enter the cave.

314
00:17:22,680 --> 00:17:25,160
This token is almost identical

315
00:17:24,920 --> 00:17:26,680
to the one I saw in the Tide Abyss...

316
00:17:28,120 --> 00:17:29,920
Master of this celestial cave ?

317
00:17:31,080 --> 00:17:32,280
No wonder.

318
00:17:34,880 --> 00:17:38,290
Inside Qing Lin's Celestial Cave
Demon Spirit Land

319
00:17:36,920 --> 00:17:39,570
It's similar to palaces of the Celestial Realm...

320
00:17:39,960 --> 00:17:42,160
It's entirely made of celestial jades...

321
00:17:47,240 --> 00:17:49,410
The restrictions here operate both as a whole

322
00:17:49,160 --> 00:17:50,400
and individually.

323
00:17:51,320 --> 00:17:53,360
It must be legendary celestial restrictions...

324
00:17:54,520 --> 00:17:56,200
With my current knowledge,

325
00:17:56,640 --> 00:17:58,960
I can't see through any of them.

326
00:18:06,560 --> 00:18:10,280
It seems there was another Master of this place before me.

327
00:18:11,640 --> 00:18:12,920
This technique...

328
00:18:13,240 --> 00:18:16,970
Could it be the 18 Plum Blossom Restriction from the ancient cultivation world !?

329
00:18:29,240 --> 00:18:32,040
Although my predecessor already drank most of the wine,

330
00:18:32,400 --> 00:18:34,080
there are still 10 drops left.

331
00:18:34,680 --> 00:18:36,280
This celestial wine

332
00:18:36,760 --> 00:18:38,480
is definitely no ordinary thing.

333
00:18:47,480 --> 00:18:49,160
The celestial wine is mellow...

334
00:18:49,480 --> 00:18:51,480
It can even intoxicate the Origin Soul...

335
00:18:52,280 --> 00:18:53,880
At the time, I didn't expect

336
00:18:54,400 --> 00:18:55,800
that this intoxication

337
00:18:56,680 --> 00:18:58,680
would last a full year.

338
00:19:02,500 --> 00:21:07,410
Time passed by. Wang Lin continued to cultivate at the Black Armor Barracks. After absorbing the demonic spiritual energy of more than 500 demon soldiers and Regiment Leader Sun, the demon crystal in his body broke past rank 1000 when he finally fused them all.

Absorbing demonic spiritual energy with a rank 1000 plus demon crystal was several times faster than before.

Wang Lin didn’t care about any of the matters in the military camp. He spent all his time absorbing demonic spiritual energy to prepare for breaking into the late stage of Soul Transformation.

339
00:19:08,190 --> 00:19:14,080
I've been walking this path for endless years

340
00:19:10,490 --> 00:19:14,080
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

341
00:19:14,470 --> 00:19:19,680
Is it the compass of fate

342
00:19:16,310 --> 00:19:19,680
that wrote this outcome for us ?

343
00:19:19,590 --> 00:19:25,600
The heavens want to erase your existence,

344
00:19:25,470 --> 00:19:31,320
that's the obsession guiding me.

345
00:19:31,350 --> 00:19:36,920
Is this the path to uncover

346
00:19:33,230 --> 00:19:36,920
truths from falsehoods ?

347
00:19:36,950 --> 00:19:42,520
In a world of murk and shadow,

348
00:19:38,850 --> 00:19:42,520
only the flame of truth can light the way.

349
00:19:42,310 --> 00:19:48,240
Look at them all,

350
00:19:45,190 --> 00:19:48,240
being carried by the waves.

351
00:19:48,430 --> 00:19:52,880
Look at them all,

352
00:19:50,590 --> 00:19:52,880
being drowned.

353
00:19:52,710 --> 00:19:56,200
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

354
00:19:55,990 --> 00:19:59,280
I will let the world refine my soul.

355
00:19:59,160 --> 00:20:04,840
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

356
00:20:00,850 --> 00:20:04,840
I will fight.

357
00:20:04,590 --> 00:20:07,960
I'll break through the abyss of despair

358
00:20:07,710 --> 00:20:11,000
to finally learn who I really am.

359
00:20:10,750 --> 00:20:16,360
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

360
00:20:12,630 --> 00:20:16,360
I embrace this obsession.

361
00:20:16,110 --> 00:20:19,320
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

362
00:20:19,070 --> 00:20:22,120
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

363
00:20:21,870 --> 00:20:27,600
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

364
00:20:23,910 --> 00:20:27,600
I'll still fight.

365
00:20:27,550 --> 00:20:30,960
It's hard to avoid loneliness

366
00:20:30,710 --> 00:20:34,000
when you are above everyone else.

367
00:20:33,750 --> 00:20:39,680
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

368
00:20:36,070 --> 00:20:39,680
be afraid of a firefly ?
